  "details": "# Issue:\n\nRight now you can open the profile of a user through the Quick Menu Here Tab by either clicking on their user icon or by clicking on \"View User Details\" button. It feels a bit weird that you can't just click on the name as that's how you did it before.\n\n# Suggestion:\n\nAllow us to open the User Profile of someone by just clicking on their name. This is what feels the most natural in my opinion, especially when compared to having an extra button for that.  \n\nIf you do this you could probably consider removing the \"View User Details\" button as it would be kinda redundant .\n\n# Attachments:  \n\nHere is a picture showcasing what area you should be able to click on to open someone's User Profile:",
